silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_vet_record_entry a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "VetRecordRegistryEntryExample" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_05_federation_olog_register_concrete_anchor_vet_record_entry silm:hasExample "In 'VetRecordRegistryEntry', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The first entry in FedReg_Mittens is the pair (VetRecord_Mittens, lambda_evidence). VetRecord_Mittens is the typed object; lambda_evidence is the aboutness arrow to Mittens. This entry enables observability of Mittens via the physical vet record.." .
